IMDb Movie Rating Web Scraping

Project Description

This project uses Python web scraping techniques to collect IMDb movie details and ratings. It extracts movie-related information and stores the collected data in CSV and HTML formats for easy access and analysis.

Technologies Used

- Python
- BeautifulSoup
- Requests
- Pandas
- HTML
- CSV

Project Features

- Automated movie data collection
- IMDb movie ratings extraction
- Data storage in CSV format
- HTML output generation
- Easy access to scraped movie information

Project Files

- "imdb_scraper.py" – Main Python scraping program
- "imdb_movie_ratings.csv" – Movie ratings data
- "imdb_results.html" – Scraped results
- "scraped_quotes.csv" – Scraped quotes data
- "title.ratings.tsv.gz" – IMDb ratings dataset

Conclusion

This project demonstrates how Python can be used for web scraping and collecting movie rating information for data analysis.
